  "query_preview": "/FRIDAY THROUGH TUESDAY/...\nIssued at 250 AM CDT Wed Aug 12 2026\n\nFriday through Tuesday...Latest ensemble and upper jet trends \nsuggest the upper ridge and heat dome to get presses eastward \nagain with some amplitude thrust up the mid to upper MS RVR \nValley with west coast L/W troffiness establishment. This could \nmake for another heat and storm track battle zone on Friday for \nthe region, until the track then gets shunted more to the north \nacrs MN and WI while we heat up again. Still on the southern \nfringe, couldn't rule out MCS seepage down this far south into \nthe local at times over the weekend as well. The action may last\ninto early next week with longer range signs of upper ridge \ndampening and flattening to get us back under the influence of \nring of fire periphery.",
